    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yahuudah Oo U Adeegaya Nebukadnesar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bilowgii boqornimadii Yehooyaaqiim ina Yoosiyaah oo boqor ka ahaa dalka Yahuudah ayaa erayganu Yeremyaah xagga Rabbiga uga yimid, isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu igu leeyahay, Waxaad samaysataa xadhko iyo harqood, oo waxaad kor saartaa qoortaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ugu sii dhiibtaa boqorka dalka Edom, iyo boqorka dalka Moo'aab, iyo boqorka reer Cammoon, iyo boqorka Turos, iyo boqorka Siidoon gacanta wargeeyayaasha Yeruusaalem ugu yimid boqorka dalka Yahuudah oo Sidqiyaah ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ku amartaa inay sayidyadooda ku yidhaahdaan, Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaad sayidyadiinna ku tidhaahdaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigu dhulka, iyo dadka iyo xayawaanka dhulka joogaba waxaan ku sameeyey xooggayga weyn iyo gacantayda fidsan, oo waxaan siiyaa kii ila qumman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haatan dalalkan oo dhan waxaan siiyey addoonkayga Nebukadnesar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo weliba xayawaanka duurkana isagaan siiyey inay u adeegaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo quruumaha oo dhammuna way u wada adeegi doonaan isaga, iyo wiilkiisa, iyo wiilka wiilkiisa, ilaa wakhtiga dalkiisu yimaado, oo dabadeedna quruumo badan iyo boqorro waaweyn ayaa isaga addoonsan doona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Quruuntii iyo boqortooyadii aan u adeegin Nebukadnesar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo diida inay qoortooda ka hoos mariyaan harqoodka boqorka Baabuloon, quruuntaas waxaan ku ciqaabi doonaa seef iyo abaar iyo belaayo, ilaa aan iyaga gacantiisa ku baabbi'iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba idinku innaba ha maqlina nebiyadiinna iyo waxsheegyadiinna, iyo riyolowyadiinna, iyo faaliyayaashiinna amase xataa saaxiriintiinna ee idinku yidhaahda, Idinku uma aad adeegi doontaan boqorka Baabuloon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waayo, been bay idiinku sii sheegaan, si ay dalkiinna idinkaga fogeeyaan, oo aan anigu dibadda idinku kexeeyo, oo aad u halligantaan aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Quruuntii qoorteeda ka hoos marisa harqoodka boqorka Baabuloon inay isaga u adeegto aawadeed, taas dalkeedaan ku dayn doonaa, oo beeraheeday sii fali doontaa, wayna sii degganaan doontaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weliba erayadan oo dhanna waan kula hadlay Sidqiyaah oo ah boqorka dalka Yahuudah, oo waxaan ku idhi, Qoortiinna ka hoos mariya harqoodka boqorka Baabuloon, oo u adeega isaga iyo dadkiisa, oo saas ku noolaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal maxaad adiga iyo dadkaaguba seefta iyo abaarta iyo belaayada ugu dhimanaysaan, sida Rabbigu uga hadlay quruuntii aan u adeegin boqorka Baabuloon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innaba ha maqlina nebiyada idinka hadla ee leh, Uma aad adeegi doontaan boqorka Baabuloon, waayo, iyagu been bay idiin sii sheegaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Anigu sooma aan dirin, laakiinse been bay magacayga ku sii sheegaan, si aan idiin eryo, oo aad u halligantaan, idinka iyo nebiyada wax idiin sii sheegaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wadaaddada iyo dadkan oo dhanba, waan la hadlay oo waxaan ku idhi, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Innaba ha maqlina erayadii nebiyadiinna wax idiin sii sheega, oo idinku yidhaahda, Bal ogaada, weelashii guriga Rabbiga mar dhow baa Baabuloon laga soo celin doonaa, waayo, iyagu been bay idiin sii sheegaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyaga ha maqlina. Boqorka Baabuloon u adeega, oo saas ku noolaada, waayo, bal maxay magaaladani cidla u noqonaysaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse iyagu hadday nebiyo yihiin, iyo haddii eraygii Rabbigu uu iyaga la jiro, haatan Rabbiga ciidammada ha ka baryeen in weelasha ku hadhay guriga Rabbiga, iyo guriga boqorka dalka Yahuudah, iyo Yeruusaalem gudaheeduba ayan Baabuloon tegin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu ka leeyahay tiirarka, iyo berkedda, iyo saldhigyada, iyo weelasha magaaladan ku hadhay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo uusan Nebukadnesar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon qaadan markuu maxaabiis ahaanta u kaxaystay boqorkii dalka Yahuudah oo ahaa Yekonyaah ina Yehooyaaqiim iyo saraakiishii dadka Yahuudah iyo reer Yeruusaalemba, oo intuu Yeruusaalem ka kaxaystay uu Baabuloon la tegey, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu ka leeyahay weelasha ku hadhay guriga Rabbiga iyo guriga boqorka dalka Yahuudah, iyo Yeruusaalemba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Iyaga waxaa loo qaadan doonaa Baabuloon, oo halkaasay oolli doonaan ilaa maalinta aan soo booqan doono, oo dabadeedna waan soo qaadi doonaa oo meeshan baan ku soo celin doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
